    <!--
        TurtleLauncher Color Theme — "Slate Blue" repaint
        ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
        Every color below is sourced only from the Endiq spec palette:

        Backgrounds  #0D1117 Main  #161B22 Secondary  #1E2630 Cards
                     #252F3D Elevated Cards  #111827 Sidebar/Topbar
        Primary Blue #3B82F6 / hover #60A5FA / pressed #2563EB / glow #93C5FD
        Cyan Accent  #38BDF8 / hover #67E8F9 / pressed #0EA5E9
        Buttons      Primary #3B82F6, Secondary #2A3441 (hover #364152,
                     pressed #1E2630), text #FFFFFF
        Text         Primary #FFFFFF, Secondary #C9D1D9, Muted #8B949E,
                     Disabled #6E7681
        Inputs       bg #1E2630, border #30363D, focus #3B82F6,
                     placeholder #8B949E
        Navigation   active #3B82F6, indicator #60A5FA, inactive #8B949E
        Borders      normal #30363D, hover #4B5563, selected #3B82F6
        Status       success #22C55E, warning #FBBF24, error #EF4444,
                     info #38BDF8
        Progress     track #222B36, fill #3B82F6
        Effects      shadow #66000000, overlay #88000000,
                     blue glow #333B82F6, cyan glow #2238BDF8
        Logo gradient #60A5FA → #3B82F6 → #2563EB

        No color outside this list appears anywhere in this file. Where the
        old theme needed a shade this spec doesn't define (e.g. a distinct
        "favorite/heart" red, or a second error-state background), the
        nearest semantic match above is reused rather than inventing a new
        hex value.
        ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    -->

